Perfect Dark XBLA PC Recomp
===========================

Scope
-----

This project's own code is released under The Unlicense, below: src/,
tools/ (except as noted below), packaging/ (except as noted below), cmake/,
the build files, perfect_dark_config.toml, and this project's changes to
ReXGlue in patches/rexglue.patch (the ReXGlue code it modifies stays under
ReXGlue's licence).

It does NOT cover, and grants no rights in:

  - Perfect Dark, its game program (default.xex), game data and assets, and
    the Perfect Dark, Rare, Xbox and Xbox 360 names and marks, which belong
    to their respective rights holders. None of these are included in this
    repository; players supply their own copy of the game.
  - Code that the ReXGlue code generator produces in generated/ from a
    player's own default.xex (a translation of the original game program).
    It is not part of this repository.
  - ReXGlue (the rexglue-sdk submodule) and the ReXGlue code that
    patches/rexglue.patch modifies, which remain under ReXGlue's own
    BSD-3-Clause licence (rexglue-sdk/LICENSE). ReXGlue includes code derived
    from Xenia (BSD-3-Clause).
  - Third-party libraries used by ReXGlue, which remain under their own
    licences (see packaging/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt).
  - packaging/launcher/stfs.cpp and tools/Extract-STFS.ps1, which are
    derived from Velocity and licensed under the GNU General Public License
    version 3 (packaging/licenses/LICENSE-Extract-STFS.txt). The launcher
    built from packaging/launcher includes stfs.cpp, so the compiled
    launcher is distributed under the GPL version 3. The other launcher
    source files are released under The Unlicense below.

